{"id":"lit-ji-yuezhang","cat":"literature","type":"词集","name":"《乐章集》","era":"两宋","year":1034,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"柳永词集，北宋最早大量创作慢词的别集，存词二百余首。","tags":["柳永","慢词","词集"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"集中以慢词为主，多写都市繁华、羁旅行役与男女之情，铺叙委曲、语言通俗，“凡有井水处，即能歌柳词”。其中《雨霖铃》《八声甘州》《望海潮》等为宋词长调的奠基之作。","body":null,"refs":"《乐章集》","categoryName":"名篇","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"cul-ci","name":"宋词","cat":"culture"},{"id":"lit-bashengganzhou","name":"《八声甘州·对潇潇暮雨洒江天》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-dielianhua-liuyong","name":"《蝶恋花·伫倚危楼风细细》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-hetianchong","name":"《鹤冲天·黄金榜上》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-wanghaichao","name":"《望海潮·东南形胜》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-yulinling","name":"《雨霖铃·寒蝉凄切》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"ppl-liuyong","name":"柳永","cat":"people"}],"sources":[]}